{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415709","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415709","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041570901:0":{"text":"惜しい、実に惜しい！あとほんのわずかで、完璧な姿になれるというのに！","source_cn":"可惜，何等可惜！只差一厘，你就是完美的形态！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F5751245BA5ABEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570902:0":{"text":"あいからわず美意識が歪んでるわねぇ、エニエ。","source_cn":"还在追求你那病态的审美吗，雷内亚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x766ADEAE17440376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570903:0":{"text":"その気になれば、お望みの「完璧に対称的な美女」にもなれるけど……あなたを誘惑してもつまらないのよねぇ……","source_cn":"我当然可以变成你所期望的样子——绝对对称的美人。可我为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DC386A04CF028A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570904:1":{"text":"あなたの欲望なんて、心の奥底を探らなくても簡単に分かっちゃうんだもの、ふふふ。","source_cn":"都用不着探测你心底的欲望，轻而易举就能猜中，呵呵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBE4281AF6BDD54A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570905:1":{"text":"低俗なそなたには、均衡の美しさなど理解できないでしょう。","source_cn":"庸俗的同胞，始终无法理解对称均衡的艺术之美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE1188FB910F111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570906:1":{"text":"理解してないのはどっちかしら。あなたが求める芸術なんて、誰が喜ぶのよ？","source_cn":"得了吧。你追求的艺术根本没人会喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50DC85966AB86434","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570907:1":{"text":"頂への道は孤独で険しい……誰にも受け入れられないからこそ、偉大なのですよ。","source_cn":"通往巅峰的道路总是崎岖又孤独。正因无人欣赏，才由此而伟大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB157287DE933F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570908:1":{"text":"そなたには才能があるのに、完璧への一歩を踏み出そうとしない。実に残念です。","source_cn":"可惜。你有造就完美的天赋，却不愿迈出步伐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3A614A94AB07282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570909:1":{"text":"あらぁ、それって褒めてるの？珍しいわねえ。","source_cn":"哎呀，你这是在称赞我吗？真是难得呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269E7D136F462697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570910:1":{"text":"今日は気分がいいから、あなたの心の奥にある欲望を叶えてあげようかしら？","source_cn":"看在我心情好的份上，不如就满足一下你心底的欲望吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1745033660C08E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570911:1":{"text":"さて、エニエちゃんは私の前で何を考えてるのかなぁ～？","source_cn":"让我看看，亲爱的雷内亚面对我的时候都在想些什么呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD5BDD8D2CDA1516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570912:1":{"text":"……\n……私を、複製したい！？","source_cn":"……\\n……复制一个我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3830A06482F579AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570913:1":{"text":"「この世にメヒラが二人存在する場合、欲望は絶対的な均衡を得られるのか」、それを確かめてみたいのですよ。","source_cn":"我在追寻此问题的答案：倘若世间存在两个梅希拉，是否欲望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9EB0C52758E547F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570914:1":{"text":"……あははっ、それは無理な話ね。私が二人になったら、あなたなんて一瞬で「落ちちゃう」わよ？","source_cn":"呵呵……失败的只会是你，雷内亚。两个我只会让你立刻沦陷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x041029C4A81707F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570915:1":{"text":"究極の芸術のためなら、試してみる価値はあります。","source_cn":"为极致的艺术，值得一试。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E201D1B0E0B963","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570916:1":{"text":"……ふん、くだらないお遊びには付き合ってられないわ。","source_cn":"……哼，我可不想陪你玩这个无聊的游戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFCF1A0E5D8C5A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570917:1":{"text":"そんな暇があるなら、もっと面白い奴を複製して私を楽しませてちょうだい。","source_cn":"有这种闲心的话，还不如多复制几个有趣的家伙来陪我玩呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58AFD9D13CAFCAE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雷内亚":{"text":"エニエ","source":"雷内亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅希拉":{"text":"メヒラ","source":"梅希拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}